Overlay patch 0054: SDL2 on iOS 27 -- interface orientation from the
window scene, not the status bar (iOS ONLY; visionOS SDL untouched).
iOS 27 made -[UIApplication statusBarOrientation] a deprecated no-op
(console: "API has been deprecated and is a no-op on 27.0 and later"). SDL
2.32.10's UIKit backend trusted it in four places, so on every activation
(Home-and-return, Notification/Control Center pull-down) it decided the
landscape-only game was portrait: SDL_OnApplicationDidChangeStatusBarOrientation
swapped the display modes to 440x956, the RESTORED event re-applied the
fullscreen mode at that size and the engine rendered a portrait 2D size into
a landscape 2868x1320 drawable -- stretched until relaunch. Under
LiveContainer (scene connects portrait, then rotates) the same flip in
UIKit_ComputeViewFrame also left the game view zero-height.
This patch:
1. Adds cmake/dependencies/patches/sdl2-ios27-orientation.patch to LUS
   (generated against release-2.32.10 WITH the 0021 visionOS-compat patch
   applied): UIKit_GetWindowScene/UIKit_GetInterfaceOrientation read
   windowScene.interfaceOrientation (Unknown or no scene -> landscape);
   UIKit_IsDisplayLandscape, the display-mode swap, the launch-image lookup
   and UIKit_ComputeViewFrame use it; ComputeViewFrame returns the scene's
   coordinate-space bounds unflipped when the window has a scene;
   SetupWindowData no longer swaps w/h for a window that has a scene; the
   view controller re-syncs the display mode on every layout pass and at the
   end of every size transition (the status-bar-orientation notification is
   not a dependable trigger any more). Every hunk sits in iOS-only code.
2. Hunks LUS cmake/dependencies/ios.cmake to apply it at configure time,
   right after SDL2's FetchContent_MakeAvailable (i.e. on top of 0021's
   PATCH_COMMAND result), and only when NOT LIGHTHOUSE_VISIONOS -- the visionOS SDL
   tree and its patch step stay byte-for-byte what they were. (Not a second
   PATCH_COMMAND: that would edit 0021's own hunk lines and break the
   overlay's already-applied probe for 0021.)
Source of truth for (1): overlay/assets/sdl2-ios27-orientation.patch, taken
VERBATIM from Shipwright-ios overlay 0059 (same SDL release-2.32.10, and this
port's sdl2-visionos-compat.patch is byte-identical to the Ship of Harkinian port, overlay 0021);
verified with `git apply --check` on the post-0021 SDL tree (the extra
sdl2-ios-native-audio-rate.patch touches only SDL_coreaudio.m).
Lighthouse D33. Generator input: the PRISTINE ios.cmake, read from the pinned
LUS commit (git show HEAD:), so it runs the same in any tree state; the
3-line context is identical before and after 0021.

